data/tarot/meanings.json is derived from Darius Kazemi's Corpora,
data/divination/tarot_interpretations.json
(https://github.com/dariusk/corpora), which is released under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The interpretations themselves are Mark McElroy's "A Guide to Tarot Card Meanings"
(2014), which its author released uncopyrighted ("you may not make any attempt to
copyright this work or limit its use").

Changes: re-keyed to TarotDeck's card keys, "coins" renamed pentacles, "light"/"shadow"
renamed upright/reversed, fortune_telling omitted.
